## Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` | `/api` | API Gateway URL |

For local development with Docker backend:
```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost/api
```

